{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/922759-contract-synergies","id":922759,"title":"Contract Synergies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-28T11:52:04-07:00","id":922759,"title":"Contract Synergies","content":"I've noticed some Contracts have cool Synergies.<br /> <br /> First example Control Element (Mirror,or something that can act as a shiny mirror like Silver/Glass/ect...) and Mirror Walk. <br /> <br /> You Control Element to make a giant Mirror Elemental, the use Mirror Walk with an ezceptional success to turn your Mirror Elemental into a 2 way portal for a scene.<br /> <br /> The other is Might of terrible Brute and Thorns and Brambles (field of thorns effects).<br /> <br /> Might of the terrible Brute boosts strength, and the orgre uses that strength to boost the damage dealt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T13:02:15-07:00","id":922802,"title":"","content":"There should be a Mirror Walk Affinity for Elementals that lets them teleport through their chosen Element, so you can do that walking teleporter trick with machines and plants. You'd be able to teleport between trees, cars, fridges and elevators, which would allow you to reach a lot of places if you're in a city or the Hedge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T13:09:11-07:00","id":922807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/922759-contract-synergies?p=922802#post922802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There should be a Mirror Walk Affinity for Elementals that lets them teleport through their chosen Element, so you can do that walking teleporter trick with machines and plants. You'd be able to teleport between trees, cars, fridges and elevators, which would allow you to reach a lot of places if you're in a city or the Hedge.</div> </div> </div> </div>Darkness. Now you can shadow-jump, call forth roiling darkness, transform into darkness, etc. And there are non-Elements related Contracts that also impose darkness, I think.<br /> <br /> If you are a Beast with Owl-like traits, you can even prank/scare vampires (and if you have Exotic Airs, soak up that sweet, sweet fear).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 06-28-2016, 04:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https